<title>UK: Argentaria Global sets 20 million stg 3-year bond. [CORRECTED 15:15 GMT]</title>
<headline>Argentaria Global sets 20 million stg 3-year bond. [CORRECTED 15:15 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ARGENTARIA GLOBAL FINANCE</p>
<p>(Corrects borrower from Argentina Global Finance, title and text)</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  CORPORACION BANCARIA DE ESPANA</p>
<p> AMT    20 MLN STG    COUPON     6.845     MATURITY    15.OCT.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.20    PAY DATE    15.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.20	LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 100</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/ES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
